    <string name="create_xml_id">Create XML id</string>
    <string name="xml_id_help">The uploaded results list will be updated with a unique id for each competitor.
        \n\nThis XML id tag is formed from each competitor\'s name and SI card.
        The combination of \"FamilyName + GivenName + SICard\" may only appear once in the event.
        \n\nShould normally be enabled. Uncheck to <b>not</b> modify the results list.
    </string>
    <string name="clear_ofeed_competitors">This will delete all competitors of this event in OFeed.
        \n\nThis cleanup can be used if duplicates have appeared in OFeed.
        The next upload will restore the competitors.
        \n\n<b>Cannot be undone!</b>
    </string>
    <string name="login_details_help">Login details are required to access OFeed.
        Server address, event id and password can be entered in various ways:
        \n\n<b>Scan QR code</b>
        \n■ Open the camera on your device and point it at the QR code. Tap on the popup link.
        The app will now start with your login details filled in.
        \n■ The QR code can also be scanned from the app\'s Settings.
        \n\n<b>Share link</b>
        \n■ Long press an OFeed link (text), select the entire link, then tap <i>Share</i>.
        In the share popup menu, tap on the app. The app will now start with your login details filled in.
        \n\n<b>Copy-paste link</b>
        \n■ Long press an OFeed link (text), select the entire link, then tap <i>Copy</i>.
        Manually launch the app, go to app\'s Settings, then tap <i>Paste link</i> to fill in the login details.
        \n\n<b>Manual setup</b>
        \n■ Enter the login details manually in the app\'s Settings.
    </string>

