        This can cause the uploading of results to stop.
        \n\nDisable battery restriction?
        \n\nThis will launch Android\'s settings for this app, where you can enable
        Battery → <b>Allow background usage</b> or <b>Unrestricted</b> (or similar wording).
    </string>

